      "statement": "The cluster-meta Kustomization deploys HelmRepository and GitRepository sources from kubernetes/flux/meta/repos/, including OCI registries like bitnami and HTTPS repositories like external-dns, with SOPS decryption enabled via the sops-age secret.",
