      "id": "claim_b0391a0195ae497e9f6a1e22fcec13e7",
      "statement": "CRD prerequisite Kustomizations (gateway-api-crds, external-dns-crds) depend on cluster-meta via dependsOn fields, ensuring sources are available before CRD installation begins.",
