    },
    {
      "id": "claim_55997818385a4cefa17c102f8241e166",
      "statement": "Application Kustomizations use postBuild.substituteFrom to inject cluster-wide configuration from the cluster-secrets Secret into manifests during reconciliation. The cluster-secrets Secret contains SOPS-encrypted environment values like SECRET_DOMAIN and TIMEZONE.",
