      "id": "claim_46b2a4a98bc346cbb4313dab4d1bef94",
      "statement": "Application Kustomizations follow a standard pattern with commonMetadata.labels for app identification, decryption via sops-age, postBuild substitution from cluster-secrets, prune enabled for garbage collection, and wait enabled for health assurance.",
